url: "https://github.com/FaizPalwala/virtual-id-gen"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FaizPalwala/virtual-id-gen"
abstract: >
  A synthetic, identity-conditioned face dataset of 16,000 images
  (400 identities × 40 images) generated via InstantID + SDXL from CC0
  synthetic SFHQ seed images.  Designed as a benchmark for machine
  unlearning with identity-level split isolation and a sequential 40-step
  forgetting protocol.  Images are 128×128 aligned face crops with proxy
  age-group labels.
keywords:
  - synthetic face dataset
  - machine unlearning
  - identity-conditioned generation
  - InstantID
  - SDXL
